    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The BootstrapMethods attribute is a variable-length attribute in the attributes table of a ClassFile structure (Section 4.1). The BootstrapMethods attribute records bootstrap methods used to produce dynamically-computed constants and dynamically-computed call sites (Section 4.4.10). </para>    </detaileddescription>
